# Risks and technical debt

{% callout type="info" title="About this chapter" %}
Name known risks and technical debt openly – with an assessment and planned measures. This creates transparency for decision-making.
{% /callout %}

| Risk / debt | Assessment | Measure |
|:---|:---:|:---|
| Dependency on a single telematics provider | {% badge color="red" %}high{% /badge %} | Integrate a second provider by Q2 |
| Unclear computation time of route optimization | {% badge color="orange" %}medium{% /badge %} | Load test with production data, see [ADR-003](09-architecture-decisions.mdoc#adr-003) |
| Missing end-to-end tests for the app | {% badge color="yellow" %}medium{% /badge %} | Test automation in the next increment |
| Legacy spreadsheet data with inconsistent vehicle IDs | {% badge color="gray" %}low{% /badge %} | Clean up during migration |
